OL,3,GNEWSAMatty Healy photo snapped in
OL,4,Aminutes up for award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA photographer has been shortlisted for
OL,7,Fa national award for a portrait he took
OL,8,Fof Matty Healy.
OL,10,FNeil Ferry, 56, from Newcastle, took
OL,11,Fthe photo in just a couple of minutes
OL,12,Fwhile the 1975 frontman was rehearsing
OL,13,Ffor his Sunday for Sammy performance in
OL,14,FFebruary.
OL,16,FFerry said Healy, 37, was a "lovely
OL,17,Fguy" and more than willing to give his
OL,18,Ftime.
